| `shell` | boolean | `true` | `true`, `false` | `config/project.json.jinja` | Sets `shell.enabled`: `false` makes every shell target (`make lint-sh`, `make fmt-sh`, `make fmt-check-sh`, `make test-sh`) say so and run no tool. It prunes nothing: the shell helper `scripts/exit_codes.sh` ships either way and the exit gate judges every shell script whatever the answer, so switching shell on later is that one key. | choosing a tool: `shell.linter`, `shell.formatter`, `shell.test_runner` | always |
